{"pageid":1585,"title":"Meteor Core","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Meteor Core</span>","revid":15101,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Meteor Core</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b4/CoreNew.png/revision/latest?cb=20240306154515\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"CoreNew\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b4/CoreNew.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240306154515\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b4/CoreNew.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240306154515 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b4/CoreNew.png/revision/latest?cb=20240306154515 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"CoreNew\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"CoreNew.png\" data-image-name=\"CoreNew.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$6,799</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Used to craft various rare items</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.37.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 18th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Meteor Core</b> is an object in Oaklands. It can be found in the crash site of a fallen <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor\" title=\"Meteor\">Meteor</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>Meteor Cores are spherical objects appearing in variegated red-to-orange colors with a luminescent glow. They are found in the middle of crash sites, with a relatively common spawn rate. In and of itself, the Meteor Core exhibits no function. However, it is an imperative component in crafting the <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a>. It can also be <a href=\"/wiki/Infused_Core\" title=\"Infused Core\">infused</a>; the infused core is an imperative component in crafting the <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tips\">Tips</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Holiday-themed meteors typically override standard meteor spawning mechanics, meaning that the Meteor Core will become more difficult to obtain in the case of a Halloween Meteor and be completely unobtainable during Christmas. Selling the Meteor Core to Players can be more Profitable. Many people pay about 20K each.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"a704f629cca65c5ca902a0598e766989\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Meteore_core-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:176px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Meteore_core.png\" title=\"Meteore core.png (345 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:176px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/Meteore_core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/177?cb=20230818180219\" title=\"Meteore core.png (345 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Old appearance of the Meteor Core\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Meteore core.png\" data-image-key=\"Meteore_core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Old appearance of the Meteor Core\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Meteore core.png (345 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Old appearance of the Meteor Core\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Meteore core.png\" data-image-key=\"Meteore_core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Old appearance of the Meteor Core\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/